  m_text: 'Resourcefulness = The productibity of a rat, how fast they work.


    Athletics
    = The likelihood that a rat returns from a plague spreading expidition.


    Tempo
    = How fast a rat moves.


    Smarts = How smart a rat is this decides whether
    they can work in the lab or not.'
